    A suite of its own: its TC IDs (SC_01_TC_001 ...) are the same as the 4 Wheeler module's in
    testng-sprint3.xml (BD2M-761), and reports group results by TC ID.

    Test data: splash.* in src/test/resources/config.properties - tests without their data are SKIPPED.
    Approved Figma design (SC_01_TC_020): src/test/resources/approved-design/splash-screen-bd2m-683/

    Eclipse: right-click this file > Run As > TestNG Suite (needs the TestNG plugin)
    Maven:   mvn test "-Dsuite=testng-sprint2-bd2m-683.xml"
    One TC:  mvn test "-Dtest=SC01_TC001_GridAutoScrollsTest" "-Ddevice=android"   (or ios)
-->
